WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:06.980
<b>Nanbaka</b>

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:12.490
<b>Idiots with Student Numbers!</b>

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.800
<i>Greetings, Mother.</i>

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.120
<b>Nanba 13th High School</b>

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:19.780
<i>How are you?</i>

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:26.600
<i>I've been assigned to Nanba 13th 
High School as of this spring to teach.</i>

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:33.570
<i>Compared to other schools, this school 
is filled with somewhat energetic...</i>

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.130
<b>Heaven and Earth</b>

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:36.790
<i>or should I say, very energetic students.</i>

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.140
<b>Strongest</b>

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:40.120
<i>Maybe unique is a better term?</i>

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:45.190
<b>Year 3 Class 13</b>

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:46.160
<i>This is the class I teach. 
Third year, Class 13.</i>

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:49.900
<i>I will teach them how wonderful it is to 
experience the prime of their lives.</i>

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.330
All right!

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:00.670
Huh? What? Um, excuse me!

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:03.910
Please open the door!
It's your teacher, Tanabata!

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:06.020
It won't open?

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:08.990
Jyugo-kun!

00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:12.760
You're hopeless.
It's like this every morning.

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:16.340
It's open.

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:18.800
S-Sorry to trouble you every day.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:21.390
Good mor—

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.390
It worked!

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:27.390
H-How could you?!

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:33.150
All right!

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:36.150
We got it! We got it!

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.030
<b>Thirteen</b>

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:40.000
Today's Seitarou fish print!

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.410
We got it again.

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:44.470
If we look at them all in turn,
maybe it'll look like he's moving.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.410
Just like an anime!

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:53.180
Why do you keep falling for 
the same trick every morning?

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:56.170
Well, who would expect them 
to keep doing it every morning?!

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:59.110
Oh, we're gonna do it every morning.

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:02.430
Oh, look. He's crying.

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:04.720
Jeez, stop teasing him!

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:07.920
Here. Your handsome face is ruined.

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.800
Thanks...

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:14.190
<i>Dear Mother... I forgot to mention it,</i>

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:16.230
<i>but this is a boys' school.</i>

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:18.820
<i>And this student is a boy, of course.</i>

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:21.280
Make sure you clean this up, Seitarou.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.990
M-Me?!

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:26.260
Of course. You <i>are</i> the newbie here.

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:30.290
Um... I'm actually a teacher.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:32.420
Thanks, Seitarou-chan.

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:37.050
Hey, Big Sis Momoko has arrived.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:42.690
She's as beautiful as ever... Big Sis Momoko!

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:44.450
Her hair looks so soft.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:48.640
Her only flaw is that her fashion 
sense is way too outdated.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.950
A yo-yo?!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.070
He got hit with marbles yesterday.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.740
I-I'm so happy...

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:08.950
<b>Hyakunin Isshu
Understanding the emotions through seasonal words</b>

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:08.950
<b>This time around
I couldn't even bring sacred streamers
To Offering Hill
But if this brocade of autumn leaves
Is to the gods' liking</b>

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:08.360
So, what did Michizane mean in this poem?

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.210
<b>Fashion</b>

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:16.460
Nico-kun, play your game at home!

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:21.470
Oh, no!

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.570
I told you to be careful.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:26.270
Nico's dangerous when he's pissed.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:27.450
Here!

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:28.850
Thanks!

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.220
Please turn off the sound, at least.

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:32.260
Okay.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:40.740
Hey, everyone. Let's pay attention 
to the lesson, shall we?

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:41.960
Who cares?

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:44.620
It's not like I'm gonna become 
a writer or something.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.510
You don't have any dreams for the future?

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.280
Of course we do!

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.120
Really?! What's your dream?

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.540
A 100% success rate when picking up girls!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.020
Getting a stone oven
installed in the cafeteria!

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:58.130
A new game and a thousand manga books!

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:01.130
Those aren't dreams. They're just wishes.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.380
Huh?!

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:05.640
Hey, where's Jyugo-kun?

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.820
He ditched class.

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:11.580
He's a genius when it comes to 
how fast he can escape a classroom.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:17.070
Hi! I'm the P.E. teacher, Yamato!

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:19.650
This is Tsukumo-kun.
He's in the celebrity course!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.280
It's lunch break!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.780
<b>Teachers' Office</b>

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:29.140
Seitarou-chan! You're still getting 
beaten up by that threesome?

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:31.400
Yes, Vice Principal.

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:34.540
See? I warned you, didn't I?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.830
Students No. 25, Nico,

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:42.300
No. 11, Uno, and No. 69, Rock, are trouble.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.300
It must be a heavy burden...

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.380
for a newcomer who's fresh out of college.

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:49.340
Um, Mr. Qi...

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:51.650
Shouldn't you be doing your 
experiment in the science lab?

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:55.820
Oh, this isn't an experiment.
It's a new medicine concoction.

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:58.590
If you don't mind, can you be 
the test subject after school?

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:00.190
I absolutely refuse!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:05.680
The teacher before you quit, too,
because those three tormented him.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.920
This is a photo from his welcome party.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.450
<b>Chu-Hi</b>

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:14.960
Student No. 15, Jyugo-kun,
is a good, relatively docile kid.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.590
That's where you're wrong.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:20.500
He's famously known as "Mad Dog Jyugo,"

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.340
and rumor has it he always carries a knife.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.130
Really?

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.300
Did you see the scratch marks on the wall?

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.200
It's all his doing.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:34.350
He's definitely on the blacklist!

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.910
<i>He doesn't look like that to me.</i>

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:44.230
Who are you?!

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:46.820
I'm Musashi, and I got 
transferred here today.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.320
Student No. 634.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:52.410
Huh?! There are only about
five or six students in this class.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.500
Why No. 634?!

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:58.880
No, there are 633 students 
in this class alone.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:01.450
They just don't come.

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:03.000
Most refuse to attend school.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.130
This class is that big?

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:08.080
Long time no see, Jyugo.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:09.760
What are you doing here?

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.520
What do you think?

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:14.220
We're gonna settle this once and for all.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.770
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:17.770
Musashi-kun?

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:21.020
There's a rumor that he's a delinquent 
who carries around a lighter.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.950
It seems he caused a small 
fire at his previous school.

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.720
Really?

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.370
Jyugo-kun and Musashi-kun...

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.200
They seemed to know each other already.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.220
What?! What?!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.660
My report.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:42.530
Okay, that's good,
but don't just unlock the door!

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:46.700
My bad. It's just that when I see 
locked doors, I have to open them.

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:47.920
Why?

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.390
Dunno.

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:53.060
Maybe I'm expecting to find it 
once I unlock the right door.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:55.150
Find what?

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:59.180
Something that will fill 
the emptiness inside me.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:01.490
Empty? You?

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:07.520
I'm jealous of them... Uno, Rock, and Nico.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:12.460
Um... Can you just close the door for now?

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.280
<b>Teachers' Office</b>

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:19.660
There's trouble! Jyugo-kun and Musashi-kun 
are gonna fight behind the gym!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.920
Wh-What did you say?!

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:25.420
What happened to them?!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.510
We can't tell with all this smoke!

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:29.580
Wait, Seitarou!

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:30.910
Don't be crazy!

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:32.550
Stop this!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.690
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:42.690
Are you awake?

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.060
What happened to Jyugo-kun and Musashi-kun?!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:49.940
Don't worry. They were expelled just now.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:51.410
Expelled?!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.320
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:56.450
Principal! Why is Jyugo getting expelled?!

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:58.540
What choice did I have?

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:02.960
Starting a fire, possessing a knife,
and destruction of property can't be ignored.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:06.000
I bet you're glad to be rid of them!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.840
In the end, all schools

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:12.090
will just pluck out anyone who's 
deemed a nuisance! It's always one-sided!

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.840
Don't, Uno.

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:14.950
But...

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:17.360
I'm okay with this.

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:19.470
Please, wait!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:22.020
They weren't carrying a lighter or a knife!

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:23.480
Seitarou...

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:27.480
Musashi-kun has a physical idiosyncrasy 
where his body spontaneously combusts,

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:31.240
and Jyugo-kun's hands just 
happen to turn into blades!

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.210
That's all!

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:34.490
That's all?

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:38.120
They're not delinquents, 
nor should they be blacklisted!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:40.020
They're just normal students!

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:43.660
They're just taking out their 
pent-up energy on each other!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:47.330
It's a natural thing for young people to do!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.640
They're students of this school!

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:52.420
Why won't you face your students head-on?!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:55.720
This really isn't about facing them head-on...

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:59.260
I want to believe in my students! That's all!

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:03.980
I don't want them to give up their 
high school life simply because

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.440
their hands turn into blades or 
their bodies spontaneously combust!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:13.860
Very good, rookie teacher.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.030
Wow, Administrator!

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.740
What you said sounds outrageous,

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:23.500
but I was touched by the compassion 
you have for the students.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:28.130
Then I guess I'll overlook it just this once.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:30.720
Jyugo!

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:31.670
All right!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:33.000
I'm so happy for you!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.380
What a tear-jerker!

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:37.510
Wh-What?

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:41.190
Are you planning to beat me up as thanks?

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:44.020
That's something we do when we graduate.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:47.040
You've got some brass ones, Mr. Tanabata.

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:49.030
You were so cool, Teacher!

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:51.020
Teacher?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:56.070
It was the first time someone 
called me "my student."

00:09:58.410 --> 00:09:59.980
See ya tomorrow.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.860
I'll search for it here a little bit longer.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:05.650
For something that fills the emptiness.

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:09.930
Oh, but please stop unlocking 
doors without permission.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:13.800
Seitarou-chan.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:14.880
Yes?

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.340
It's open.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:19.160
Jyugo-kun, that was mean!

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:19.930
Mean!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.730
See you tomorrow, Teacher!

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:23.720
Yes!

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:29.220
I'm glad I became a teacher at this school.

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:32.720
It's a bit too soon to say that.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:33.440
Huh?

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.440
That guy is coming back to school tomorrow.

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:37.500
That guy?

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:40.060
His suspension has been lifted.

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:41.950
Suspension?

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:46.950
The strongest and worst troublemaker 
in this school's history is returning.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:55.560
That guy... Student No. 1.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:01.970
<b>Nanbaka</b>

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.890
A cat is the only one greeting 
you at your return.

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:16.980
How pathetic for the worst student 
at Nanba 13th High School.

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:18.700
In the first place,

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:21.790
the man considered the 
worst thug in the Nanba district

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:27.460
walking back to school because his 
suspension was lifted is pitiful enough.

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:31.130
The cowardly way you turn 
your back makes me sick.

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:33.420
Why don't you say something?!

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:41.800
Isn't that skirt too long?

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.810
<i>So cool! So cool! So cool! So cool! So cool!</i>

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:57.860
Oh, you must be Sugoroku Hajime-kun!

00:11:57.860 --> 00:11:59.180
Nice to meet you.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:03.570
I've been teaching Class 13 since 
April. I'm Seitarou Tanabata.

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:06.580
Class has already begun, right?

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:09.360
Huh? Ah, yes... Sorry!

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:21.100
They get you every morning, don't they?

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.740
Yeah... Thank you.

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:27.110
Big Brother!

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:28.070
Welcome back!

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:29.300
Stop clinging to me!

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:30.650
Big Brother?!

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:33.210
Oh... Hitoshi Sugoroku.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:36.100
You don't look like your little sister.

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:39.480
Not sister. Brother.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:41.490
S-Sorry.

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:44.610
Huh?

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:46.620
You're taking the front seat?

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:48.620
Got a problem with it?

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:53.080
No... I just sort of expected 
you to sit way in the back.

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:05.050
Watch out!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:17.900
Oh, Big Brother... It's still morning.

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:21.440
It's been a while!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.440
Welcome back, Hajime!

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:26.700
Strong as a monster, just like always!

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:30.830
It doesn't feel like Hajime-chan 
is back without this!

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:33.720
Sit. Class has already begun.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:39.330
<b>Murasaki Shikibu
 Historical background of classic literature</b>

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:39.330
<b>As I was wondering
Whether or not I had seen it
By chance,
It became cloud-hidden,
The face of the midnight moon</b>

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:40.330
This poem is so famous that it's considered 
one of the top ten in the Hyakunin Isshu...

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:40.840
<b>Fashion</b>

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:45.100
Class is in session.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:46.760
Hajime-chan is so strict.

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:49.180
Everything's so formal when you're back.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.720
We actually have to pay attention in class.

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:56.980
He's escaped.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:57.850
<b>Whack</b>

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.120
Class is in session.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:05.360
Hey! P.E. Teacher Yamato here!

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:07.700
Tsukumo-kun doesn't have 
any classes or lines,

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.830
so he has lots of energy to spare!

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.120
Lunch time!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:13.620
Medium Soba

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:17.620
<b>Curry</b>

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:17.620
<b>Udon • Soba</b>

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:16.700
Oh? So you're back?

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.430
Such a menacing look, as usual.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:22.630
Shut it. Your makeup is too heavy, as usual.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:23.600
What?!

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:27.770
That's what you say to someone who's 
sweated in a kitchen to cook for you?!

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:29.510
How rude!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:37.890
<b>Beef bowl • Curry     Udon • Soba</b>

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:32.370
Say that when you make something edible.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.040
You're so cocky.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.390
Maybe I'll serve you an
extra-large salmon roe rice bowl.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.890
I'll shove you in the pot.

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:41.900
That's too much.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:44.150
If you don't finish it, you'll pay!

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:48.120
Old lady! I want an extra-large serving, too!

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.050
For a kid who calls me an old lady? No!

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:54.160
You always play favorites with Hajime! 
You biased old lady! Old lady!

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:57.150
For the worst student in school,

00:14:57.150 --> 00:15:02.640
he sure is attentive in class. His classmates
and the other teachers seem to like him.

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:05.420
His grades are good, too.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:08.420
But he'll go berserk soon.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:14.400
5th High School... The leaders there 
are very hostile toward Hajime.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:19.640
<b>Nanba 5th High School</b>

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:18.410
They're gonna be up to something now that 
Hajime's suspension has been lifted.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:23.280
What does a teacher from 
13th High School want, huh?!

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.890
U-Um, you see...

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:30.540
There are rumors that you students 
want to pick a fight with my students.

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:33.660
You guys heard that rumor?

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:35.320
It's not a rumor.

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:37.010
Really?

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:38.040
It's a fact.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.790
That's wrong!

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:43.100
You're so loud and annoying.

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:44.680
Are you in grade school?

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:46.060
I'll kill you.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:48.420
Uh, fighting is wrong!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.420
Are you saying you came here to stop us?

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:52.550
If possible.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:53.940
Fine.

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:57.180
But you'll have to beat me first.

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:01.180
Th-There's no way!

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:03.340
How pathetic!

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:07.720
Go back and tell Hajime to wash 
his neck and wait for us.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:11.440
Big Brother, you have sand on your neck.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.330
Be sure to wash it thoroughly.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:15.200
I know, I know.

00:16:17.840 --> 00:16:20.200
Hey! That uniform!

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:22.010
You two are from 5th High School!

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.130
You got us.

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:27.460
I guess beautiful people have 
great perception, as well.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.960
Oh, my. You noticed?

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:34.330
How do you even manage to 
say such obviously false praise?

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:37.100
On a closer look, you two aren't bad looking.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:39.470
You have beautiful skin, too, my fair lady.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.610
You noticed?

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:45.480
I'm using the latest toner! It's a
100% hyaluronic acid blend!

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:47.330
No wonder you're so beautiful.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.130
Why don't you come to our school?

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:52.860
I'll give you a great deal in the cafeteria!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:56.610
It must be delicious. In any case...

00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:01.120
No. Never mind.

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:04.320
What?! Aren't you gonna ask me about 
the color of my underwear?!

00:17:04.320 --> 00:17:05.870
I was ready!

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.500
<b>Nan</b>

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:10.250
Hey!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:13.510
Are you two hitmen from 5th?

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.050
Don't call us that. It's so revolting.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.330
Let's see...

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:19.260
Just call us ambassadors extraordinaire.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:23.390
But the way we do things 
can get a little rough.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.930
They kicked me out in the end.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.230
H-Hajime-kun?

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:36.140
Hajime, don't let 5th provoke you.

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:38.030
Get lost, guard dog!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:41.500
Um, excuse me! Did my student do something?

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:44.910
It's nothing. I'm just worried about him.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.830
Worried?

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:49.170
Hajime got suspended because

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:53.440
students from 5th High School relentlessly 
harassed him at his part-time job.

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:55.050
Part-time job?

00:17:55.050 --> 00:18:01.440
He's been working hard to earn enough 
money for his brother Hitoshi's surgery.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:02.890
What kind of surgery?

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.390
It's for Hitoshi's dream.

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:07.060
What kind of dream?

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:09.620
Such a tactless man...

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:15.120
Sorry. So many questions 
popped into my head

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:17.360
that I can't organize them.

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:29.290
Um... Fighting is wrong.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:32.880
Please cherish your youth more.

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.640
Don't sugarcoat things.

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:38.590
People will always look at 
me with prejudice anyway.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:41.850
I don't look at you like that.

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:48.600
Hajime!

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.320
<i>Sorry, Teach.</i>

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:58.210
<i>It's such a lousy school,
but 13th High School is my school.</i>

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:02.500
You finally got out of jail, Hajime.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:04.870
But you're going back in real soon.

00:19:05.070 --> 00:19:07.210
I was just suspended.

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:10.620
Your turn of phrase is not 
very clever, as usual.

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:16.380
Shut up! That knowing smirk 
of yours pisses me off!

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.760
Give back our school flag.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:20.760
Why don't you take it back?

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.940
You stay out of this.

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:25.760
Don't be stupid! I'm gonna fight, too!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.500
Your face will get banged up.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.770
Well, maybe I shouldn't.

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.770
Crush them!

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.770
Hold it right there!

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.900
I said no fighting!

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.080
Get out of the way!

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:41.150
I told you, no matter where 
we go, we're a nuisance!

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:43.030
You idiot!

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:46.100
What the hell?! Damn you!

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:53.170
I won't... I won't let you.

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:56.180
You... You guys are...

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:02.680
my precious students!

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:09.150
We've never had an idiot 
teacher like you before.

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:10.500
Hajime-kun...

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:12.820
Let's go.

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:13.980
Are you sure?

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:16.940
What a stupid farce.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:22.720
But... I wish we had a teacher like that, too.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.080
I'll fight, too.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:30.340
You're late!

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:31.960
It's over already.

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:33.460
Huh?

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:37.240
You're seriously a slow runner.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.720
<i>How are you, Teach?</i>

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:45.320
<i>It's been a year since you 
quit working at our school.</i>

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:50.280
<i>You had to quit your job 
because you hit me,</i>

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:51.990
<i>and I'm really sorry for that.</i>

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:54.900
<i>I've continued my studies since then,</i>

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.800
<i>and I now work as a correctional 
officer at a juvenile prison.</i>

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:00.340
<i>Jyugo and the rest of 
the gang are committing</i>

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:03.600
<i>stupid petty crimes just so they 
can visit me. It's so problematic.</i>

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:06.300
<i>But all is good on this end.</i>

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:11.270
<i>You taught me how wonderful it is to 
experience the prime of our lives,</i>

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:14.220
<i>and I'm now teaching that to the kids here.</i>

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:15.500
<i>Later.</i>

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:17.520
Good luck.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:21.260
I wonder what kind of students 
I'll get to meet next.

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:25.690
Huh?

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:29.890
The only student here is 5th High 
School's Samon-kun's big brother,

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.890
and the classroom is an underground prison?

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:35.890
A place like this again?!

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:39.020
<i>Dear Mother...</i>

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:43.400
<i>It seems like my turbulent life
as a teacher will continue.</i>

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.630
<i>I'll write you again soon...</i>

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:47.260
<i>from my new job location.</i>

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:48.380
<i>Seitarou.</i>
